# measure_tokens_fairness — the MEASURE.TOKENS Duo fairness guarantee, proved
# on the shipping module (ZH-048; design/blocks.yml names this file as the
# block's formal lane, and this is it populated rather than promised).
# Run with cwd = tests/formal.
#
# TWO TASKS, both required:
#   prove — P1..P6: view 0's guaranteed pools cannot move except by view 0's
#           own traffic and the frame's own reload (and the mirror image for
#           view 1); no pool ever exceeds the budget the frame loaded; a grant
#           never debits more than the pool it draws holds; the private pool is
#           tried first; and the emergency pool is unreachable by low-priority
#           refinement. Every one of those is ONE-STEP INDUCTIVE, so
#           `mode prove` (temporal induction) closes them for ALL time — which
#           is the whole reason this is not a bmc task: the interesting state
#           (a pool near empty against a near-2^32 budget) is billions of
#           tokens from reset and no bounded run of a sane depth reaches it.
#   cover  — the interesting states are REACHABLE, shown on a deliberately tiny
#           second instance (TOK_W = 4) in the same harness: a private grant, a
#           grant from the reserve, a pool emptied, the reserve emptied, a
#           denial, and a credit clamped at the budget. Without this task,
#           P1..P6 would all hold for a guard that never granted anything and
#           the proof would say nothing.
#
# SCOPE — stated plainly. This proves the FAIRNESS GUARANTEE and the pool
# arithmetic's safety, which is what the charter's sentence about this block
# actually claims. It does NOT prove the counters (pure saturating adders,
# covered at the rail by the directed lane and on 120,000 cycles by the two
# random lanes), the denial payload's `fixed:1` timing (measured directly in
# the directed lane), or the 45/45/10 numbers (they arrive from the command
# stream — law T3).
#
# NOTHING UNROLLED, NO DIVIDER, NO MULTIPLIER. The datapath is five 32-bit
# compare/add/subtract lanes and nothing else, deliberately: this repo has one
# banked property (`terrain_bake_delta.sby`) whose BMC sat for 10.7 hours on a
# 17-step restoring divide unrolled into SMT, and a proof that cannot finish is
# worse than none.
#
# Frontend: read_slang (the lane choice since W2.3). The RTL is self-contained
# — no packages — so nothing is staged or copied.

[tasks]
prove
cover

[options]
prove: mode prove
prove: depth 4
cover: mode cover
cover: depth 14
expect pass

[engines]
smtbmc boolector

[script]
read_slang --top measure_tokens_fairness_fv zhao_measure_tokens.sv measure_tokens_fairness_fv.sv
prep -top measure_tokens_fairness_fv

[files]
../../fpga/rtl/measure/zhao_measure_tokens.sv
measure_tokens_fairness_fv.sv
